{"objects":[{"id":"flow","instance":"instance--b96dad5f-c519-5a1f-a718-912ca4a86c02","objects":["attack-action--1","attack-action--2","attack-action--3","attack-action--4","attack-action--5","attack-action--6","attack-action--7","attack-action--8","attack-action--9","attack-action--10","attack-condition--1","attack-condition--2","attack-operator--1","url--1","email-message--1","user-account--1","domain-name--1","domain-name--2","domain-name--3","domain-name--4","domain-name--5","domain-name--6","domain-name--7","domain-name--8","domain-name--9","domain-name--10","domain-name--11","software--1","software--2","software--3","instance--f825654a-7f81-50f7-a4e3-715efc45ad7a","instance--fe58d3c1-faa4-512f-a0c3-fa75b622e227","instance--057c9c6b-5f9d-5a42-a700-338d5f0eb74a","instance--338a08d1-596c-5134-86e1-58bc27da7116","instance--b6d82c28-0a68-5c6f-b058-c1e072f51852","instance--3622ace1-abf1-5f6e-a5de-a6f584dc1f66","instance--56b40d44-cc57-5e8b-b320-779a685089fd","instance--895aab9a-87c3-51d8-91f8-cc3f6dd1a5a5","instance--dfa2fce4-9d69-5153-93a9-85314db1e8c4","instance--b3aa1b20-0a98-5bee-9b24-afe8c9468e2a","instance--b889ee7f-4869-55e7-ad10-3ecd21e634df","instance--d23a7e3b-28ba-5c82-b661-c8eb109d42d1","instance--b6301b03-e1db-5d07-8b01-10b9d63abc5a","instance--e1fdbfcc-98c5-5401-a510-7f70aaad43ca","instance--e6439bc0-f06b-5307-8fe8-0018002dfdea","instance--be93ed74-3dbb-599e-9f91-0be3e00498e6","instance--91117560-f974-53ba-b574-dc23d8394759","instance--a4462b35-e722-5c18-8447-b09f33874519","instance--9e3be026-a976-5dff-8c1f-924cb55a1460","instance--51e1d6e4-8e5a-52c4-b922-b6694f565a46","instance--8670f11d-bcf5-512b-9e23-c01a496e9998","instance--c8996f1e-64e7-5b36-93ea-0f43ffc752b3","instance--fb1b73fc-fd18-5978-98b3-0b17b9600664","instance--1ef0131e-32f1-5d46-85f8-d7ccdfa8f90e","instance--173441c6-1008-5751-99f9-58342199a450","instance--42ac6045-bb4e-5fcb-9e25-317156017541","instance--a9c67147-971a-547b-a8d5-069f70cad4b5","instance--215f7fd2-9d0c-5d54-a6ed-20d1f45696ce","instance--2679a2d8-9177-53a5-b969-62fb12fe03cf","instance--810c84c0-f46d-5e4c-a486-b9e160587bfb","instance--759ac8af-0ddb-54c6-b818-04d31289655a"],"properties":[["name","Charming Kitten Christmas holiday phishing campaign"],["description","During the Christmas holidays and the beginning of the new year, the Charming Kitten group, the Iranian state-backed hackers, have begun a targeted phishing campaign of espionage against different individuals to collect information."],["scope","campaign"],["author",[["name","CERTFA"]]],["external_references",[["item-1",[["source_name","blog.certfa.com"],["url","https://blog.certfa.com/posts/charming-kitten-christmas-gift/"]]]]]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--ad592d05-6969-5b51-98a8-1ad9b6aab896","120":"instance--5850a8f4-8241-5e73-9bf0-dcd376cd5025","150":"instance--0da1498f-3beb-5916-a249-e0410a4a81e4","180":"instance--d3632784-7391-5a29-83e2-edab51db56c6","210":"instance--8bc47ca5-ca73-5a04-a9ea-918608f10871","240":"instance--6546eef6-c5ad-516e-a417-89916e651648","270":"instance--244e5a69-f465-564e-9d2c-93d4da44fc57","30":"instance--6a1fca3c-fdb6-536a-bbea-61ac2349a700","300":"instance--043a5b44-2864-5565-abce-1909204e5485","330":"instance--e10eb918-2b0b-56f4-9c82-f345ce21276c","60":"instance--33a99d1b-dad8-51f6-be74-e1614db9151b","90":"instance--380c79e9-b1eb-547c-bf01-a011db1201c1"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--1","properties":[["name","Select espionage targets"],["description","Additionally, based on the collected evidence, it is clear that Charming Kitten specifically chose their targets from members of think tanks, political research centers, university professors, journalists, and environmental activists in the countries around the Persian Gulf, Europe, and the US."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0043","technique":"T1591"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--4f4d03a8-4502-5010-997b-9943e254395b","120":"instance--cefe62ac-5b6e-5ead-84fc-b4c632913a73","150":"instance--4d07a740-2467-5b95-ac8d-4a2ee8edd11e","180":"instance--1205f03c-a457-5a0b-87ef-3bbb7aac110f","210":"instance--96e7dc6a-9f86-5f69-8d45-a566303cd4c0","240":"instance--66237af6-bb19-5a51-9fa2-cbc4a96186f5","270":"instance--836dfd42-b475-50ca-9acf-4f11bd32b89f","30":"instance--efe92997-cc5c-538a-90bc-c09ffb1379f4","300":"instance--9c4a24ae-1426-5cb5-9d7c-792e6dd325b7","330":"instance--06c6a74a-ca7d-5703-88ea-a06a0933d21a","60":"instance--5e4f84e5-56b7-5b8f-9bc3-b4d59d371123","90":"instance--019deb6a-bab3-57db-9a53-11e3564bf7a4"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--2","properties":[["name","Send fake recovery SMS"],["description","Like many other phishing attacks, in this phishing campaign, Charming Kitten uses a fake SMS (Figure 1) to trick their victims. They send confirmation messages stating \u2018Google Account Recovery\u2019 to their targets; they claim these messages are sent by Google and the user must follow the link in the SMS to confirm the identity."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0001","technique":"T1660"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--0ce35aea-35a2-52ae-a67b-985306bdefe7","120":"instance--312639d5-e6d9-57b1-850d-28f0a1eac2f6","150":"instance--9551a25e-2558-512e-9894-dd64a8d662bf","180":"instance--403becce-e0ad-5dcd-bc14-7c00453907da","210":"instance--2305f501-2712-5ec6-9d4e-1371b011e937","240":"instance--cf1b8cf6-1cbd-5afb-b653-aa693889dab5","270":"instance--1d3dc59a-40a0-5670-aa3e-1304ff762003","30":"instance--77063d4f-503a-5e9b-b622-15aa2cc6a8e7","300":"instance--beaab67f-8a54-5982-8c5d-9d2ed2d42c9f","330":"instance--4d3274ff-ef14-5a53-99be-01575194a98e","60":"instance--4154a6bf-290b-5fce-a557-5dc0f3e700fb","90":"instance--2992bc0b-df57-54e5-a17b-03a964338c09"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--3","properties":[["name","Send fake email lure"],["description","Another method used in this phishing campaign is sending fake emails with deceptive titles like \u201cMerry Christmas, and sending note/book/photo and others\u201d, which are usually sent by previously hacked emails.\n\nFigure 2 shows one of these phishing emails where the attackers cordially invite the target to open the link in the email\u2019s body. In order to achieve this, Charming Kitten used the subject \u201cNew Years Greetings\u201d with convincing sentences such as \u201cThis year I decided to make my friends happy with my last book. Here\u2019s my special Xmas gift for you.\u201d in the body of email."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0001","technique":"T1566.002"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--0f6e4da7-a5f4-54d7-866f-3bc6e8bcb019","120":"instance--015254b5-0906-577e-b3e3-3899f837d118","150":"instance--f7af5b8c-330a-58d5-b0da-a3d5f0bc6ad0","180":"instance--9f27ab21-2382-567d-b022-74ad5a29bd08","210":"instance--d799eb0a-7600-5b1a-a298-c47a78ceae4b","240":"instance--911c2c52-5974-5e08-b0b6-a9084d57c6ee","270":"instance--286444b4-97a1-58cd-9ca3-cffa04a15351","30":"instance--92192c38-5143-50e0-8c39-a96ea86e32e2","300":"instance--82bb3de0-bea5-5651-a1de-583283258c6d","330":"instance--4f0945c8-f644-50ce-8796-fea52a29dda1","60":"instance--16c43a2d-7356-521d-a507-5922e2c3337b","90":"instance--abce5c62-339a-5ed5-a0b8-dd66136cfe2f"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--4","properties":[["name","Resend alternative phishing email"],["description","We believe that Charming Kitten continuously try different styles of email to trap their victims as quickly as possible. For example, Figure 3 shows another fake email that was sent to the same victim a day after the initial email (Figure 2)."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0001","technique":"T1566.002"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--a469636c-0cb2-50b9-92f9-644c8aa98197","120":"instance--d57b3a21-e910-5879-8148-40165cea451a","150":"instance--58250ef4-5bb4-5bf3-b33e-89493bbb395d","180":"instance--3e769cf2-c1e5-5d2e-81d4-892f48ce4d86","210":"instance--f6499e41-749c-5d7f-9346-96c08d0d5dfd","240":"instance--d9dcdfc8-5f42-546a-803a-0efcd5d4cf91","270":"instance--c9afd0f6-97ce-57b2-9d60-3557b6214809","30":"instance--75f82155-f5ff-5619-8bf8-aae22937cab0","300":"instance--25e2d26e-1b35-56bd-b9aa-096c2d3b0e3c","330":"instance--e0483688-da10-5376-8cf2-050bcc3b70f0","60":"instance--1293d9cc-16b2-5c67-a453-bd144aab133a","90":"instance--2b43cd52-10db-5b15-8ad5-c4b59496528b"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--5","properties":[["name","Create redirect chain with legitimate services"],["description","Our examination shows the hackers have used a mix of services such as \u2018script.google.com\u2019 and \u2018iplogger.org\u2019 in this campaign in order to create a chain of redirection to obfusticate their hacking operations. Redirection links initially help bypass the security layers in email services, and then provide the attackers more control to redirect the target to the final URL."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0001","technique":"T1566.002"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--54fc1f38-f4e3-523e-b07c-73889b0d8df7","120":"instance--9cf45948-7040-5d7a-a1d5-3cb4db0c1af6","150":"instance--13bb13cc-e02b-51d2-8d7d-40e5613b6e5a","180":"instance--e33bc6ee-771e-54fe-a772-74dfdaad420d","210":"instance--286f51a3-8fc6-55ec-978e-8b05ebda3655","240":"instance--14659696-be77-5460-beb1-4b5eac126e43","270":"instance--f48ed1a6-2895-5cd2-9b1c-e30ac2bc8921","30":"instance--7b803e61-16ac-5720-92cd-8f2a456a52b7","300":"instance--76c24361-5143-5c43-8e4d-707c619e6038","330":"instance--f395cfc7-395a-5001-9552-a4fec6dbc53a","60":"instance--760885bb-9294-5a5b-93a2-a410e1ea4112","90":"instance--8e0d1a12-8611-598d-9a7d-40f2525e4781"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--6","properties":[["name","Redirect victims to phishing domains"],["description","After opening the links and several redirections, the victims are led to final phishing domains such as \u201cmobile[.]recover-session-service[.]site\u201d etc."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0001","technique":"T1566.002"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--7cccbcd0-a724-54fb-be4f-ac523d26f7d0","120":"instance--738e44b2-1357-5eb3-82bd-8a0ce8942b72","150":"instance--d31f4735-6339-5929-8d7c-d30863cf166f","180":"instance--2252393d-d801-5931-ad38-4b53374a9880","210":"instance--065b5ad5-023a-5336-b458-e9c9dcda2976","240":"instance--5ea0dd2b-5eac-51f8-855a-4cbcb801bc2d","270":"instance--bba66874-a069-56c6-bb95-967cb3cefc9e","30":"instance--6377c09d-ecb4-5567-a2f4-4dde56ff4f98","300":"instance--ede3430f-b16b-58ae-be71-1d1f1a194336","330":"instance--7772f482-8ee2-569a-b600-7528c065d4e0","60":"instance--98139a98-16b0-54fe-8c77-3473c1b520cd","90":"instance--5cb9cc95-e190-5a68-985d-0a94d39299e6"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--7","properties":[["name","Use deceptive brand domains"],["description","Our investigation shows Charming Kitten has targeted different people and organisations in relatively different fields. For example, based on our initial findings, the hackers use domain names such as mail-newyorker[.]com, news12[.]com[.]recover-session-service[.]site with the intention of targeting \u201cThe New Yorker\u201d online magazine readers and \u201cNews 12 Networks\u201d TV channel staff and their audience.\n\nCharming Kitten had previously used the same method using names such as Wall Street Journal , CNN , Deutsche Welle , etc."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0001","technique":"T1583.001"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--5150f7cc-6f25-5eb3-a6fc-5099ced4caf4","120":"instance--64a408ce-c543-55d6-a9dd-206ce7cadbb2","150":"instance--1b71e413-cfd2-528c-8792-dc7dd1bb9938","180":"instance--aa12ce11-0165-52b6-b72d-e4d9070e9fbb","210":"instance--5d8b0f08-14bc-58f4-9316-b25a92dd09a6","240":"instance--34f96b84-9453-53f2-ae07-d28c04665e6c","270":"instance--415f1d54-1cd4-5ba7-8071-4aa99bc946ac","30":"instance--18834cac-b4c4-57b0-88ea-5a62fdb27cf9","300":"instance--de4f9957-1ac6-5782-86ea-f1a3b6a9ad13","330":"instance--8eff940b-86bb-556f-8c85-c7c47577b3ed","60":"instance--14a123fd-5626-5e69-8257-6dcd64c28ec0","90":"instance--02294ff1-7261-5db8-8e0d-b9e818922053"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--8","properties":[["name","Host fake credential pages"],["description","In reviewing other samples, we have found that Charming Kitten has used many fake domains to target different online accounts in different services. Although accounts such as Gmail, Yahoo! and Outlook are the main targets of this campaign, there are more samples that show this Iranian hacking group targets other services such as Planet.com and PlanetObserver.com - both are online satellite imagery services for special sectors such as governments, industries, and military defenses - which shows the breadth of their campaign. Figures 6 to 8 are different series of phishing pages that were developed by Charming Kitten.\n\nFigure 6. A fake Google Drive page to steal credential details of a Google account.\n\nFigure 7. An initial copy of Planet.com on an Iranian free hosting website to create a fake login page and steal the credential details of Planet.com\u2019s users. This page has been recently transferred to hello-planet[.]com.\n\nFigure 8. A fake website of PlanetObserver.com"],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0001","technique":"T1660"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--180f2983-9c1a-56f4-99d6-c990125f7baa","120":"instance--c7f65318-7600-57f4-a8ac-992357e695ff","150":"instance--95523e1a-0a1d-52ef-944c-23f9cbc50233","180":"instance--bc8eb48d-411d-5877-aa9b-966476b71207","210":"instance--4cc5026e-07f9-5327-9912-5d278a0a3321","240":"instance--d6a7d51d-39a4-5eb3-8831-f23437781b95","270":"instance--cac30e05-5f01-5b4f-b5c0-6b975297df2d","30":"instance--cb0751b0-c027-5895-a460-a72e48920c71","300":"instance--f41cdc1f-abb7-5ff7-81c2-bf2235a7faab","330":"instance--b114cbda-9ec8-5612-b2f8-93c36811cafb","60":"instance--f28e5296-2041-5fe9-992d-4c70d549191e","90":"instance--3ea39244-da0f-5435-8745-f2afa8b13872"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--9","properties":[["name","Steal account credentials"],["description","A review of samples of this phishing campaign shows that the attackers concentrated their attacks on individuals\u2019 online accounts, especially personal emails (Gmail, Yahoo! and Outlook) and business emails (organization and university emails). After accessing the credential details of the accounts, they steal sensitive data from their victims."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0006","technique":"T1056"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--db5fab04-54d4-5eec-a429-185861eb2719","120":"instance--985391bd-d017-5935-ab31-3b4b56331b02","150":"instance--092bb98d-fc30-5f69-b6b7-e3024f3ec65a","180":"instance--755129e6-612e-5b63-a780-1c886d98909b","210":"instance--431723d9-dd8c-5190-9dab-6f346173c044","240":"instance--5b9fb821-54fe-5f22-bba3-038263245910","270":"instance--3c6777cb-6430-544b-b31a-01b198524553","30":"instance--c070071b-a9a3-52fe-8956-a51744db200b","300":"instance--a9a4289c-d995-5783-9544-a8b45052eb56","330":"instance--344009cc-e024-5c68-9246-51e85e00d45c","60":"instance--86c77621-2c1d-59c3-b398-e62f4b48a3dd","90":"instance--67627b08-1913-5f3d-8318-52d3bda9c1c3"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--10","properties":[["name","Steal sensitive account data"],["description","A review of samples of this phishing campaign shows that the attackers concentrated their attacks on individuals\u2019 online accounts, especially personal emails (Gmail, Yahoo! and Outlook) and business emails (organization and university emails). After accessing the credential details of the accounts, they steal sensitive data from their victims."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0010","technique":"T1537"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--35652c79-2c41-5d60-81ba-b5e47aa554bf","120":"instance--53906203-fffb-5af3-b112-44a9b4b49b8f","150":"instance--465fbc8a-7b4c-569f-be00-c0fbc137fcfc","180":"instance--a653c96b-3673-5dfa-968e-188fffe4cc04","210":"instance--6a344cf5-bd5c-52db-84f5-23c7701c7a5e","30":"instance--913561d1-b5f3-54d2-8272-159233dfde54","330":"instance--d59fe52d-c897-5f3a-919a-c2273cb8a8b3","60":"instance--f1fd6a3d-bb83-543d-a379-39d4632978f7","90":"instance--4cd6fce2-0d24-57f0-b161-12a867cd1100","branch:False":"instance--f7e897b3-3607-5ea5-8d15-5f83ba8a60da","branch:True":"instance--39b5ac19-b0dd-5674-a7d9-d75e659fe9ea"},"id":"condition","instance":"attack-condition--1","properties":[["description","After opening the links and several redirections, the victims are led to final phishing domains such as \u201cmobile[.]recover-session-service[.]site\u201d etc."]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--2ff8b105-17d8-5bc8-9736-a71ca9281068","120":"instance--fe9b11f7-9a07-51c8-93b2-02f34148833b","150":"instance--15f0676c-2f2f-58cf-99a3-b5eade2d286e","180":"instance--cdc5e3d9-a0b4-5995-98a3-d1a29532ffb1","210":"instance--75ed5df8-ff2f-5667-9748-b8587a1ee318","30":"instance--46009917-4258-54e5-9e91-c46c4a45d34d","330":"instance--54845373-a5f0-5af0-b348-5b0a3b4fbe67","60":"instance--f1f8d9a5-1f2a-55c4-af9a-f2629bc0827a","90":"instance--ddfb6e54-4af9-5771-910f-b4c7ba6e9860","branch:False":"instance--64607b7d-a4bd-56e7-9116-7bc21201c8bf","branch:True":"instance--f635d174-aa29-531f-b9c8-0cc481c6c1dd"},"id":"condition","instance":"attack-condition--2","properties":[["description","After accessing the credential details of the accounts, they steal sensitive data from their victims."]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--36aad375-d405-5e3b-9a7d-4346c75c9f45","120":"instance--acc72955-e581-59b3-80b5-35fb047df4b8","150":"instance--d5d0ec7c-da1b-5d39-86e4-8de8792ab05d","180":"instance--047e7862-d9c4-5716-b778-899a86595b48","210":"instance--650a6d3c-5cb0-5f82-83ec-c5d828e2502b","240":"instance--3f08654d-fd5e-59cb-af47-8bbcee29de39","270":"instance--e175549d-38ff-5527-bdb8-de5e1a12f356","30":"instance--c6e60459-b005-50cd-9e68-66ef210b5456","300":"instance--f90b34f0-8620-5a56-9e11-4db2b889aac4","330":"instance--93872aee-cf81-52fa-aa93-f7a84a833dbd","60":"instance--5a877a06-3649-5bba-9461-5faee75ea842","90":"instance--68af6616-0e27-5395-b4ff-5d95b55a2405"},"id":"OR_operator","instance":"attack-operator--1","properties":[["operator","OR"]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--c2e84d8b-5164-58c2-9526-5d9d9d6f8872","120":"instance--af5c0c72-1f78-51b9-b888-1250a72e1fca","150":"instance--07b79917-15e4-5f09-a207-d6f6152473e0","180":"instance--d05c509a-2080-5c66-b004-314696535967","210":"instance--ec78c273-5dc9-521e-82ca-c99e22fd2dfd","240":"instance--09e6b23b-983e-5ca8-a8a9-931fc6216b82","270":"instance--9e22dc2c-a31a-5d2b-84c9-f5e2abf6350b","30":"instance--bd8dfcfd-57e3-5a3c-9235-52fb080a08dc","300":"instance--8e4c8523-3ca6-553d-8710-b2ebee87da5b","330":"instance--b9c09a1c-f198-5c14-a9ec-37102767f73c","60":"instance--ecbb9ccd-93ad-5523-92a7-2479833ce664","90":"instance--fb906e97-d671-55d7-ba8b-9eeb36dc827a"},"id":"url","instance":"url--1","properties":[["value","hxxps://www.google[.]com/url?q=https://script.google.com/xxxx"],["evidence",[["item-1",{"excerpt":"The most important point in this method is the structure of the link in the SMS that seems legitimate: hxxps://www.google[.]com/url?q=https://script.google.com/xxxx.","source":"https://blog.certfa.com/posts/charming-kitten-christmas-gift/"}]]],["display_name","hxxps://www.google[.]com/url?q=https://script.google.com/xxxx"]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--20bbe9f2-ac00-5017-9562-e92ae507e48d","120":"instance--2e844599-4e31-5871-a7c7-04a9c6ce5691","150":"instance--af5a54f1-2b8c-545d-ab59-74cfcebc16f4","180":"instance--c5b59f65-14ce-5c4a-a55a-13ec896deba8","210":"instance--4eb49c2e-b94f-5fdb-a122-d3d8ef90a239","240":"instance--f44660ee-8226-5061-bd29-40feb73e9125","270":"instance--e53b4d9e-5807-50d1-8720-771760b10cc8","30":"instance--730673ac-abcd-57b3-beb5-b2a2dc74a310","300":"instance--1f38467e-7168-5f0b-afe0-9b6769dfade6","330":"instance--d12be42a-ab98-5684-af05-3cad546477bb","60":"instance--96b259a7-f838-5604-a32e-dff12cea472e","90":"instance--01fc9195-8db0-5e99-9765-45e395d2a35a"},"id":"email_message","instance":"email-message--1","properties":[["subject","New Years Greetings"],["evidence",[["item-1",{"excerpt":"In order to achieve this, Charming Kitten used the subject \u201cNew Years Greetings\u201d with convincing sentences such as \u201cThis year I decided to make my friends happy with my last book. Here\u2019s my special Xmas gift for you.\u201d in the body of email.","source":"https://blog.certfa.com/posts/charming-kitten-christmas-gift/"}]]],["display_name","New Years Greetings"],["is_multipart","false"]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--cba0db2f-4c26-5332-99c5-b2aee8fd787f","120":"instance--d8fb103f-8665-5f80-9047-210dfff8d4c0","150":"instance--edc40449-4888-59a1-9397-f5c8d35412fc","180":"instance--4252ed4d-ac52-5ce9-b1de-22e62358c57f","210":"instance--ef2d806c-0b9d-5611-a51f-36bdd082998e","240":"instance--ec0c67c0-158e-5415-b08b-15c497764894","270":"instance--a848e595-3d48-563d-8a20-94fb272a5c7a","30":"instance--3c5974dd-03ad-5327-9c64-210b94c5a53b","300":"instance--276d1f29-b75a-59cc-9eed-4b08918a5156","330":"instance--890f4571-fa81-56df-b189-618233836d08","60":"instance--2dd9e3f9-0428-53d4-807b-4d5e12c46854","90":"instance--caf97c38-c923-57ff-b66b-316622e455c9"},"id":"user_account","instance":"user-account--1","properties":[["account_login","previously hacked emails"],["evidence",[["item-1",{"excerpt":"Another method used in this phishing campaign is sending fake emails with deceptive titles like \u201cMerry Christmas, and sending note/book/photo and others\u201d, which are usually sent by previously hacked emails.","source":"https://blog.certfa.com/posts/charming-kitten-christmas-gift/"}]]],["display_name","previously hacked emails"]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--00e90443-789d-55ae-8126-3a7794ac656d","120":"instance--a43dcc13-9ef6-5b4b-982d-2c8cf0768a5e","150":"instance--911b6bfe-c769-5fa4-8f45-cab82f4474df","180":"instance--907614ab-26be-5940-ace9-cae9a85c59aa","210":"instance--58a2ad0a-5c4a-5e34-a11b-7ea1016ffc6d","240":"instance--784e8552-59ac-5ee2-97ea-d40383f55932","270":"instance--5f396c69-b265-580d-b427-3f4fd278cacf","30":"instance--1bd0e48c-f48a-5ae6-b221-680a6657775d","300":"instance--886a9595-6f23-5fb7-8fba-0322a64dda9c","330":"instance--caa23a43-1a98-5748-9447-07e74da20c2d","60":"instance--29108f93-0a82-55cc-a38c-0cc5a75b715f","90":"instance--0594f6e7-e0dd-5307-969c-2b3703ae91c2"},"id":"domain_name","instance":"domain-name--1","properties":[["value","script.google.com"],["evidence",[["item-1",{"excerpt":"Our examination shows the hackers have used a mix of services such as \u2018script.google.com\u2019 and \u2018iplogger.org\u2019 in this campaign in order to create a chain of redirection to obfusticate their hacking operations.","source":"https://blog.certfa.com/posts/charming-kitten-christmas-gift/"}]]],["display_name","script.google.com"]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--83e0cd15-1eae-5e8b-bf88-e7066803efbd","120":"instance--182e6fd9-8e79-52f3-bf4b-ec522b538b08","150":"instance--89266d4e-94a7-553b-bc06-058a426c094c","180":"instance--e0ef5eba-c7fd-5101-bbd1-5466509e768d","210":"instance--ced4b976-771a-5e39-87e5-d1caa1cc5fa2","240":"instance--15316233-db05-597e-936e-5619565f43b6","270":"instance--76850bfb-5060-51ab-8052-a45f1103b41e","30":"instance--19122bbb-83fb-5560-8577-41ede0b3dc17","300":"instance--8676222a-e297-5c18-ba5e-1f9f8bb3e116","330":"instance--39c7abd9-77f3-5487-9510-d1cd94a51eb9","60":"instance--93846c38-cff8-5d7e-b3a4-6e4d0acb7e0e","90":"instance--c613ac6c-e939-5b3c-a8d6-be5c03fd675b"},"id":"domain_name","instance":"domain-name--2","properties":[["value","iplogger.org"],["evidence",[["item-1",{"excerpt":"Our examination shows the hackers have used a mix of services such as \u2018script.google.com\u2019 and \u2018iplogger.org\u2019 in this campaign in order to create a chain of redirection to obfusticate their hacking operations.","source":"https://blog.certfa.com/posts/charming-kitten-christmas-gift/"}]]],["display_name","iplogger.org"]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--bf0082d0-bdb4-53bd-b71d-bb8d78b230c6","120":"instance--c519ad92-aeda-58ae-b7c8-0375bcbdab0e","150":"instance--8a495707-dbea-5dc9-b8db-2698a24b1322","180":"instance--06d280ad-63c0-5591-99c0-8137cba45d5c","210":"instance--e6a